{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜亞馬遜行政總裁透露 AWS算力預訂排至2028年 今年容量全數售罄           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">人工智能熱潮帶動全球企業算力需求急升，亞馬遜行政總裁Andy Jassy披露，旗下雲端業務AWS今年的運算容量已經悉數售罄。2027年的相關容量大部分已獲客戶預訂，2028年也有相當部分容量售出。他表示集團可靈活調整設備採購規模，又指早年收購Annapurna Labs是集團歷來最佳收購之一。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T15:23:00.574474+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T09:00:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T15:19:47.255421+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T15:19:47.255421+00:00","content_hash":"316e877b6f61c752bb567d84327f58ed807e63294ad42f0e2957c93f658128d6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}